1283
01:02:42,500 --> 01:02:47,480
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: ISDA Skills and Production for Track 2 covers aquaculture, sustainable practices,

1284
01:02:47,940 --> 01:02:52,460
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: fishing processing, food safety, hatchery operations, and post-harvest activities.

1285
01:02:52,460 --> 01:02:57,260
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: Track 3, or Blue Enterprise Development, supports qualified beneficiaries

1286
01:02:57,260 --> 01:02:57,980
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: who are ready to start their business.

1287
01:02:57,980 --> 01:03:04,000
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: To organize into fisheries-related micro-enterprises with starter support and operational coaching.

1288
01:03:04,600 --> 01:03:07,480
